# --- Google Drive & Forms (teacher homework) ---
# Web application OAuth client (not Desktop). Authorized redirect URI:
#   https://www.saltmorning.study/api/teacher/google/callback
#   http://localhost:8790/api/teacher/google/callback
# Enable APIs: Google Drive API, Google Forms API
